<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('layout-partials/head', { title: 'Already answered' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="status-page">
    <div class="status-page__card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Thanks for playing 💛</p>
      <h1 style="font-size: 26px;">You already answered this one.</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink);">&ldquo;<%= instance.question %>&rdquo;</p>
      <p>Someone cared enough about you to ask that as a tiny game instead of just a text.</p>
      <a href="/games" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-top: 16px;">Send a game to someone</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
